(1973,23,'RELATIONSHIP_SOCIAL','BASIC','EN','KR',3,'Let''s do that','그렇게 하자','상대의 제안을 받아들이는 Let''s do that','상대가 낸 의견에 ''그렇게 하자''라고 동의하는 표현이에요. that이 방금 상대가 말한 그 방법을 가리켜요. 무엇을 하자고 다시 설명할 필요 없이 이 한마디면 충분해요.','Do you want to use the dryer together?','건조기를 같이 쓸래?','Good idea. Let''s do that.','좋은 생각이야. 그렇게 하자.',ARRAY['Good','idea','Let''s','do','that']::varchar[],ARRAY['Good','this','idea','do','Let''s','Lets','does','that']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/1973/representative/3b1613ae-dd1b-4e50-a711-0005f82198a6.webp','[{"sentenceText": "Sure. Let''s do that.", "highlightingPart": "Let''s do that", "sentenceTranslation": "좋아. 그렇게 하자.", "practiceQuestion": "Should we wash our clothes on Sunday?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "일요일에 빨래할까?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Sure", "Let''s", "do", "that"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Sure", "Lets", "does", "do", "that", "this", "Let''s"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["좋아", "그렇게", "하자"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["그렇게", "그렇게는", "싫어", "했어", "하자", "좋아"]}, {"sentenceText": "Nice. Let''s do that today.", "highlightingPart": "Let''s do that", "sentenceTranslation": "좋다. 오늘 그렇게 하자.", "practiceQuestion": "Let''s put our names on the baskets.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "바구니에 이름 붙이자.", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Nice", "Let''s", "do", "that", "today"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Nice", "today", "that", "does", "do", "Lets", "tomorrow", "Let''s"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["좋다", "오늘", "그렇게", "하자"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["하자", "내일", "오늘", "좋다", "싫다", "그렇게", "했어"]}, {"sentenceText": "Let''s do that from now on.", "highlightingPart": "Let''s do that", "sentenceTranslation": "앞으로 그렇게 하자.", "practiceQuestion": "We could share the dryer to save money.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "건조기 같이 쓰면 돈 아낄 수 있어.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/23/expressions/1973/practice-examples/db506eb9-9586-4e42-825f-41a4709ec710.webp", "sente