(2038,17,'MONEY_SPENDING','BASIC','EN','KR',4,'a small one','작은 걸로','작은 사이즈를 고르는 a small one','''작은 걸로 주세요''라고 크기를 고를 때 쓰는 표현이에요. 여기서 one은 앞에 나온 물건을 다시 말하지 않으려고 쓰는 말이에요. 큰 걸 원하면 a big one이나 a large one이라고 해요.','What size would you like?','어떤 사이즈로 드릴까요?','A small one, please.','작은 걸로 주세요.',ARRAY['A','small','one','please']::varchar[],ARRAY['A','smalls','ones','please','large','one','small']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2038/representative/d4f9a3e9-bb29-41cc-b909-9284c229ac0d.webp','[{"sentenceText": "A small one is enough.", "highlightingPart": "A small one", "sentenceTranslation": "작은 걸로 충분해요.", "practiceQuestion": "We have three sizes.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "사이즈가 세 가지 있어요.", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["A", "small", "one", "is", "enough"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["ones", "A", "big", "is", "one", "smalls", "small", "enough"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["작은", "걸로", "충분해요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["작은", "걸로", "모자라요", "충분해요", "충분했어요", "큰"]}, {"sentenceText": "Still, a small one, please.", "highlightingPart": "a small one", "sentenceTranslation": "그래도 작은 걸로 주세요.", "practiceQuestion": "The large is only one dollar more.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "큰 건 1달러만 더 내시면 돼요.", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Still", "a", "small", "one", "please"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["small", "ones", "large", "smalls", "please", "a", "one", "Still"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["그래도", "작은", "걸로", "주세요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["주셨어요", "걸로", "주세요", "그래서", "그래도", "큰", "작은"]}, {"sentenceText": "A small one, the white cup.", "highlightingPart": "A small one", "sentenceTranslation": "작은 걸로요, 하얀 컵이요.", "practiceQuestion": "Which cup do you want?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "어떤 컵으로 드릴까요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/17/expressions/2038/practice-examples/bd0767ed-e57c-49bb-b8a6-22d16fd7fe0c.webp", "sentenceWords": ["A", "small", "one", "the", "white", "cup"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["white", "ones", "small", "cup", "the", "one", "smalls", "black", "A"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["작은", "걸로요", "하얀", "컵이요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["컵이었어요", "검은", "큰", "하얀", "작은", "걸로요", "컵이요"]}, {"sentenceText": "No, a small one is fine.", "highlightingPart": "a small one", "sentenceTranslation": "아니요, 작은 걸로 괜찮아요.", "practiceQuestion": "Do you want a bigger size?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "더 큰 사이즈로 드릴까요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/17/expressions/2038/practice-examples/08a8de3d-22eb-42d1-8f68-8edb07c8585d.webp", "sentenceWords": ["No", "a", "small", "one", "is", "fine"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["one", "smalls", "No", "big", "ones", "is", "fine", "a", "small"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["아니요", "작은", "걸로", "괜찮아요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["큰", "괜찮아요", "괜찮았어요", "아니요", "걸로", "작은", "네"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',1,now(),now()),
(2039,17,'MONEY_SPENDING','BASIC','EN','KR',1,'I''ll take ~','~로 할게요','주문을 확정하는 I''ll take ~','''~로 할게요''라고 고른 것을 확정할 때 쓰는 표현이에요. 여기서 take는 ''가져가다''가 아니라 ''선택하다''는 뜻이에요. 카페, 식당, 상점 어디서나 결정을 알릴 때 그대로 쓸 수 있어요.','Welcome! What would you like to drink today?','어서 오세요! 오늘은 어떤 음료로 하시겠어요?','I''ll take a latte, please.','라떼로 할게요.',ARRAY['I''ll','take','a','latte','please']::varchar[],ARRAY['please','the','latte','take','I''ll','a','takes','took']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2039/representative/47520a1a-4ab7-4707-9161-0f9f3d8e0672.webp','[{"sentenceText": "Then I''ll take that one.", "highlightingPart": "I''ll take", "sentenceTranslation": "그럼 그걸로 할게요.", "practiceQuestion": "We recommend the new tea.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "새로 나온 차를 추천드려요.", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Then", "I''ll", "take", "that", "one"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["I''ll", "take", "Then", "this", "that", "took", "takes", "one"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["그럼", "그걸로", "할게요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["이걸로", "했어요", "그걸로", "할게요", "말고", "그럼"]}, {"sentenceText": "I''ll take the muffin.", "highlightingPart": "I''ll take", "sentenceTranslation": "머핀으로 할게요.", "practiceQuestion": "The muffin or the scone?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "머핀이요, 스콘이요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["I''ll", "take", "the", "muffin"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["take", "I''ll", "a", "muffin", "the", "takes", "took"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["머핀으로", "할게요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["머핀으로", "할게요", "했어요", "둘다", "스콘으로"]}, {"sentenceText": "Yes, I''ll take the set.", "highlightingPart": "I''ll take", "sentenceTranslation": "네, 세트로 할게요.", "practiceQuestion": "Would you like a set menu?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "세트 메뉴로 하시겠어요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/17/expressions/2039/practice-examples/904f1c75-6dbb-43d6-897c-02161045f9ab.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Yes", "I''ll", "take", "the", "set"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["the", "I''ll", "takes", "sets", "took", "set", "take", "Yes"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["네", "세트로", "할게요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["할게요", "세트로", "단품으로", "네", "아니요", "했어요"]}, {"sentenceText": "Great, I''ll take two.", "highlightingPart": "I''ll take", "sentenceTranslation": "좋네요, 두 개로 할게요.", "practiceQuestion": "This one is on sale today.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이건 오늘 할인 중이에요.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/17/expressions/2039/practice-examples/9e31afb7-b310-462b-b548-a5063d867573.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Great", "I''ll", "take", "two"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["take", "takes", "to", "I''ll", "two", "Great", "took"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["좋네요", "두", "개로", "할게요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["한", "개로", "좋네요", "별로네요", "할게요", "했어요", "두"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',2,now(),now()),
(2040,17,'DAILY_ROUTINE','BASIC','EN','KR',2,'iced','얼음을 넣은, 아이스','차가운 음료를 가리키는 iced','''얼음을 넣은''이라는 뜻이에요. 카페에서는 cold coffee가 아니라 iced coffee라고 해야 자연스러워요. ice에 -ed가 붙어 ''얼음이 들어간 상태''를 나타내는 형용사가 됐어요.','Would you like it hot or iced?','따뜻한 걸로 드릴까요, 아이스로 드릴까요?','Iced, please. It''s hot today.','아이스로 주세요. 오늘 덥네요.',ARRAY['Iced','please','It''s','hot','today']::varchar[],ARRAY['hot','today','please','It''s','Iced','Ice','icy','cold']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2040/representative/7fd4e710-c97f-4cd2-9161-152ff1461d0b.webp','[{"sentenceText": "An iced americano, please.", "highlightingPart": "iced", "sentenceTranslation": "아이스 아메리카노 주세요.", "practiceQuestion": "What can I get you?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "뭘 드릴까요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["An", "iced", "americano", "please"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["ice", "americano", "An", "iced", "icy", "A", "please"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["아이스", "아메리카노", "주세요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["아이스", "따뜻한", "라떼", "아메리카노", "주세요", "주셨어요"]}, {"sentenceText": "I drink iced tea all year.", "highlightingPart": "iced", "sentenceTranslation": "저는 일 년 내내 아이스티를 마셔요.", "practiceQuestion": "Hot tea is popular in winter.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "겨울엔 따뜻한 차가 인기예요.", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["I", "drink", "iced", "tea", "all", "year"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["icy", "ice", "drinks", "iced", "all", "year", "tea", "I", "drink"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["저는", "일", "년", "내내", "아이스티를", "마셔요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["년", "겨울에만", "내내", "일", "마셨어요", "마셔요", "따뜻한", "아이스티를", "저는"]}, {"sentenceText": "Yes, I ordered it iced.", "highlightingPart": "iced", "sentenceTranslation": "네, 아이스로 주문했어요.", "practiceQuestion": "Should I add ice?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "얼음 넣어드릴까요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/17/expressions/2040/practice-examples/81691b31-d699-4b34-982e-142f4cb5f9e7.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Yes", "I", "ordered", "it", "iced"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["iced", "ice", "I", "Yes", "it", "icy", "order", "ordered"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["네", "아이스로", "주문했어요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["아니요", "네", "주문했어요", "아이스로", "따뜻하게", "주문할게요"]}, {"sentenceText": "Yes, iced costs the same.", "highlightingPart": "iced", "sentenceTranslation": "네, 아이스도 같은 가격이에요.", "practiceQuestion": "Is the iced version the same price?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "아이스도 같은 가격인가요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/17/expressions/2040/practice-examples/f2a1e16a-43b6-4bcb-867b-8e72e7d3fd4d.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Yes", "iced", "costs", "the", "same"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["ice", "costs", "cost", "the", "same", "icy", "Yes", "iced"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["네", "아이스도", "같은", "가격이에요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["같은", "아이스도", "아니요", "네", "가격이에요", "더", "가격이었어요"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',2,now(),now()),
(2041,17,'TRAVEL_MOVEMENT','BASIC','EN','KR',3,'to go','포장으로, 가져가는 걸로','테이크아웃을 뜻하는 to go','''가지고 갈 것''이라는 뜻이라 우리말의 ''포장''에 해당해요. 매장에서 먹는 건 for here라고 해서 짝으로 외워두면 좋아요. 영국에서는 to go 대신 takeaway를 더 자주 써요.','Is that for here or to go?','매장에서 드시겠어요, 포장하시겠어요?','To go, please. I''m in a rush.','포장으로 주세요. 좀 급해서요.',ARRAY['To','go','please','I''m','in','a','rush']::varchar[],ARRAY['I''m','please','To','a','rush','going','go','goes','in','went']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2041/representative/6a5711f8-a51f-42ff-8bc1-8e801fec6d02.webp','[{"sentenceText": "No, it''s to go.", "highlightingPart": "to go", "sentenceTranslation": "아니요, 포장이에요.", "practiceQuestion": "Would you like a tray?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "쟁반 드릴까요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["No", "it''s", "to", "go"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["went", "No", "Yes", "it''s", "go", "to", "going"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["아니요", "포장이에요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["매장이에요", "아니요", "포장이에요", "포장이었어요", "네"]}, {"sentenceText": "Yes, both to go.", "highlightingPart": "to go", "sentenceTranslation": "네, 둘 다 포장으로요.", "practiceQuestion": "Two coffees, correct?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "커피 두 잔 맞으시죠?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Yes", "both", "to", "go"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["went", "to", "one", "both", "go", "going", "Yes"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["네", "둘", "다", "포장으로요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["아니요", "네", "하나만", "다", "둘", "포장으로요", "포장이었어요"]}, {"sentenceText": "A paper cup, please. It''s to go.", "highlightingPart": "to go", "sentenceTranslation": "종이컵으로 주세요. 포장이에요.", "practiceQuestion": "Do you want it in a mug?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "머그컵에 드릴까요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/17/expressions/2041/practice-examples/ba9f2f40-a9ac-41ff-afbb-5b47cbb5bfbf.webp", "sentenceWords": ["A", "paper", "cup", "please", "It''s", "to", "go"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["paper", "go", "It''s", "cup", "please", "went", "A", "going", "to", "cups"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["종이컵으로", "주세요", "포장이에요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["매장이에요", "주세요", "머그컵으로", "포장이에요", "주셨어요", "종이컵으로"]}, {"sentenceText": "No, I''ll get it to go.", "highlightingPart": "to go", "sentenceTranslation": "아니요, 포장할게요.", "practiceQuestion": "Are you staying?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "드시고 가시나요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/17/expressions/2041/practice-examples/e94aa2de-a80d-41cf-8348-f95f1f9c0cc2.webp", "sentenceWords": ["No", "I''ll", "get", "it", "to", "go"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["it", "No", "go", "I''ll", "went", "to", "gets", "get", "going"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["아니요", "포장할게요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["포장했어요", "네", "매장에서", "아니요", "포장할게요"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',3,now(),now()),
(2042,17,'MONEY_SPENDING','BASIC','EN','KR',4,'a large one','큰 걸로','큰 사이즈를 고르는 a large one','''큰 걸로 주세요''라고 크기를 고를 때 쓰는 표현이에요. one은 앞에 말한 물건을 대신하는 말이라 a large coffee를 다시 말하지 않아도 돼요. 카페에서는 large 대신 big을 잘 쓰지 않아요.','What size would you like?','어떤 사이즈로 하시겠어요?','A large one, please.','큰 걸로 주세요.',ARRAY['A','large','one','please']::varchar[],ARRAY['small','ones','A','large','larges','please','one']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2042/representative/bec2dd3a-18cd-4166-a336-552c5d02a3fb.webp','[{"sentenceText": "A large one, thanks.", "highlightingPart": "A large one", "sentenceTranslation": "큰 걸로요, 감사합니다.", "practiceQuestion": "Regular or large?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "보통이요, 큰 거요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["A", "large", "one", "thanks"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["thanks", "small", "ones", "one", "A", "larges", "large"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["큰", "걸로요", "감사합니다"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["보통", "감사합니다", "걸로요", "작은", "큰", "감사했어요"]}, {"sentenceText": "That''s fine. A large one, please.", "highlightingPart": "A large one", "sentenceTranslation": "괜찮아요. 큰 걸로 주세요.", "practiceQuestion": "The large is two dollars more.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "큰 건 2달러 더 비싸요.", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["That''s", "fine", "A", "large", "one", "please"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["A", "fine", "That''s", "large", "ones", "one", "please", "small", "larges"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["괜찮아요", "큰", "걸로", "주세요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["큰", "걸로", "비싸네요", "주세요", "주셨어요", "괜찮아요", "작은"]}, {"sentenceText": "Only if it''s a large one.", "highlightingPart": "a large one", "sentenceTranslation": "큰 걸로만 주시면요.", "practiceQuestion": "Is one cup enough for you?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "한 잔이면 충분하세요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/17/expressions/2042/practice-examples/520de5e8-aad7-4738-9f3c-2cbe2608cc53.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Only", "if", "it''s", "a", "large", "one"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["if", "a", "ones", "one", "Only", "larges", "large", "it''s", "small"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["큰", "걸로만", "주시면요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["충분해요", "주시면요", "주셨어요", "큰", "걸로만", "작은"]}, {"sentenceText": "Sure, let''s get a large one.", "highlightingPart": "a large one", "sentenceTranslation": "좋아요, 큰 걸로 시키죠.", "practiceQuestion": "How about sharing a drink?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "음료 하나 나눠 드실래요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/17/expressions/2042/practice-examples/ae514d3d-5d95-4667-a476-072c0ee9ec05.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Sure", "let''s", "get", "a", "large", "one"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["small", "a", "large", "one", "let''s", "get", "Sure", "larges", "ones"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["좋아요", "큰", "걸로", "시키죠"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["작은", "싫어요", "걸로", "좋아요", "시켰어요", "시키죠", "큰"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',2,now(),now()),
(2043,16,'POLITE_EXPRESSION','BASIC','EN','KR',1,'No, thank you','아니요, 괜찮아요','상대의 제안을 정중히 거절하는 No, thank you','제안을 받아들이지 않으면서도 예의를 지키는 표현이에요. No만 말하면 차갑게 들리는데 thank you를 붙이면 훨씬 부드러워져요. 낯선 사람의 제안을 거절할 때 가장 무난하게 쓸 수 있어요.','Hi. Would you like to get coffee with me?','안녕하세요. 저랑 커피 한잔하실래요?','No, thank you.','아니요, 괜찮아요.',ARRAY['No','thank','you']::varchar[],ARRAY['Yes','me','you','No','thank','thanks']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2043/representative/879fd109-c148-4b9c-8287-47eb4a4739b6.webp','[{"sentenceText": "No, thank you. I''m okay.", "highlightingPart": "No, thank you", "sentenceTranslation": "아니요, 괜찮아요. 저는 됐어요.", "practiceQuestion": "Would you like to get coffee with me?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "저랑 커피 한잔하실래요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["No", "thank", "you", "I''m", "okay"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["No", "thanks", "Yes", "thank", "okay", "you", "I''m", "me"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["아니요", "괜찮아요", "저는", "됐어요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["저는", "할게요", "됐어요", "네", "좋아요", "괜찮아요", "아니요"]}, {"sentenceText": "No, thank you. Not today.", "highlightingPart": "No, thank you", "sentenceTranslation": "아니요, 괜찮습니다. 오늘은 아니에요.", "practiceQuestion": "Can I buy you a drink?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "제가 음료 한 잔 사 드릴까요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["No", "thank", "you", "Not", "today"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["thank", "today", "Not", "thanks", "tomorrow", "No", "you", "Yes"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["아니요", "괜찮습니다", "오늘은", "아니에요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["아니요", "괜찮습니다", "맞아요", "아니에요", "내일은", "네", "오늘은"]}, {"sentenceText": "No, thank you. I''m not interested.", "highlightingPart": "No, thank you", "sentenceTranslation": "아니요, 괜찮아요. 관심 없어요.", "practiceQuestion": "Do you want my phone number?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "제 번호 받으실래요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2043/practice-examples/9458a93e-29b4-4059-a25f-ca60eeb0ff56.webp", "sentenceWords": ["No", "thank", "you", "I''m", "not", "interested"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["thanks", "No", "not", "you", "thank", "interested", "interesting", "I''m", "Yes"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["아니요", "괜찮아요", "관심", "없어요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["없어요", "아니요", "관심", "좋아요", "있어요", "괜찮아요", "네"]}, {"sentenceText": "No, thank you. I have to go.", "highlightingPart": "No, thank you", "sentenceTranslation": "아니요, 괜찮아요. 저는 가 봐야 해요.", "practiceQuestion": "Just one coffee? It won''t take long.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "커피 한 잔만요? 오래 안 걸려요.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2043/practice-examples/665f78f9-9896-455c-ae12-0e19a6498a95.webp", "sentenceWords": ["No", "thank", "you", "I", "have", "to", "go"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Yes", "thank", "have", "go", "I", "you", "stay", "thanks", "to", "No"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["아니요", "괜찮아요", "저는", "가", "봐야", "해요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["가", "저는", "아니요", "봐야", "괜찮아요", "갔어요", "좋아요", "해요", "네"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',1,now(),now()),
(2044,16,'POLITE_EXPRESSION','BASIC','EN','KR',2,'Sorry, I can''t','죄송해요, 안 돼요','미안함을 담아 거절하는 Sorry, I can''t','상대의 부탁이나 제안을 못 받아들일 때 미안함을 앞에 붙이는 표현이에요. Sorry를 먼저 말해서 거절이 딱딱하게 들리지 않아요. 뒤에 today나 right now를 붙이면 언제 안 되는지도 알려 줄 수 있어요.','Hi. Would you like to get coffee with me?','안녕하세요. 저랑 커피 한잔하실래요?','Sorry, I can''t right now.','죄송해요, 지금은 안 돼요.',ARRAY['Sorry','I','can''t','right','now']::varchar[],ARRAY['later','now','I','right','can''t','Thanks','cannot','Sorry']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2044/representative/53e0a3ce-87f5-48a0-a02e-a756cf650f10.webp','[{"sentenceText": "Sorry, I can''t today.", "highlightingPart": "Sorry, I can''t", "sentenceTranslation": "죄송해요, 오늘은 안 돼요.", "practiceQuestion": "Would you like to get coffee with me?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "저랑 커피 한잔하실래요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Sorry", "I", "can''t", "today"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["We", "Sorry", "today", "cannot", "can''t", "tomorrow", "I"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["죄송해요", "오늘은", "안", "돼요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["고마워요", "오늘은", "돼요", "잘", "죄송해요", "안", "내일은"]}, {"sentenceText": "Sorry, I can''t tomorrow either.", "highlightingPart": "Sorry, I can''t", "sentenceTranslation": "죄송해요, 내일도 안 돼요.", "practiceQuestion": "How about tomorrow evening?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "내일 저녁은 어떠세요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Sorry", "I", "can''t", "tomorrow", "either"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Sorry", "I", "tomorrow", "either", "today", "can''t", "neither", "cannot"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["죄송해요", "내일도", "안", "돼요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["안", "죄송해요", "오늘도", "고마워요", "돼요", "잘", "내일도"]}, {"sentenceText": "Sorry, I can''t give it.", "highlightingPart": "Sorry, I can''t", "sentenceTranslation": "죄송해요, 알려 드릴 수 없어요.", "practiceQuestion": "Can I have your number?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "번호 좀 알 수 있을까요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2044/practice-examples/5f1edacb-42eb-41f1-a7d2-7ad392aac947.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Sorry", "I", "can''t", "give", "it"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["it", "give", "I", "Sorry", "cannot", "gave", "them", "can''t"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["죄송해요", "알려", "드릴", "수", "없어요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["없어요", "드릴", "있어요", "알려줬어요", "수", "죄송해요", "고마워요", "알려"]}, {"sentenceText": "Sorry, I can''t. I work.", "highlightingPart": "Sorry, I can''t", "sentenceTranslation": "죄송해요, 안 돼요. 저는 일해요.", "practiceQuestion": "Are you free this weekend?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이번 주말에 시간 있으세요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2044/practice-examples/fdc8d330-54dd-4323-ad96-72c9da3f140d.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Sorry", "I", "can''t", "I", "work"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["works", "work", "rest", "cannot", "can''t", "I", "I", "Sorry"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["죄송해요", "안", "돼요", "저는", "일해요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["저는", "고마워요", "잘", "쉬어요", "안", "죄송해요", "일해요", "돼요"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',1,now(),now()),
(2045,16,'DAILY_ROUTINE','BASIC','EN','KR',3,'I''m busy','저는 바빠요','시간이 없다고 짧게 알리는 I''m busy','지금 할 일이 많아서 시간을 내기 어렵다고 말하는 표현이에요. 거절 이유를 길게 설명하지 않아도 이 한마디로 충분히 전해져요. 뒤에 right now나 today를 붙이면 언제 바쁜지 분명해져요.','I understand. Do you want me to leave now?','알겠어요. 지금 갈까요?','Yes, I''m busy right now.','네, 저는 지금 바빠요.',ARRAY['Yes','I''m','busy','right','now']::varchar[],ARRAY['No','I''m','Yes','then','now','busy','right','busier']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2045/representative/aad12939-1001-4cbd-8ad1-3ab313da04a3.webp','[{"sentenceText": "No, I''m busy right now.", "highlightingPart": "I''m busy", "sentenceTranslation": "아니요, 지금 바빠요.", "practiceQuestion": "Do you have a minute?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "잠깐 시간 있으세요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["No", "I''m", "busy", "right", "now"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["now", "free", "busy", "No", "Yes", "right", "I''m", "busier"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["아니요", "지금", "바빠요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["아니요", "바빠요", "한가해요", "나중에", "지금", "네"]}, {"sentenceText": "I''m busy. I have a meeting.", "highlightingPart": "I''m busy", "sentenceTranslation": "바빠서요. 회의가 있어요.", "practiceQuestion": "Why are you walking so fast?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "왜 이렇게 빨리 걸으세요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["I''m", "busy", "I", "have", "a", "meeting"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["busier", "I", "I''m", "a", "meetings", "have", "busy", "had", "meeting"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["바빠서요", "회의가", "있어요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["없어요", "수업이", "있어요", "바빠서요", "회의가", "한가해서요"]}, {"sentenceText": "Sorry, I''m busy at work.", "highlightingPart": "I''m busy", "sentenceTranslation": "죄송해요, 회사 일로 바빠요.", "practiceQuestion": "Can we talk for five minutes?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "5분만 얘기할 수 있을까요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2045/practice-examples/9e908ef8-b316-44de-be21-c6ed710dcc08.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Sorry", "I''m", "busy", "at", "work"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["works", "busier", "at", "busy", "Sorry", "I''m", "work", "on"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["죄송해요", "회사", "일로", "바빠요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["바빠요", "일로", "회사", "한가해요", "죄송해요", "고마워요", "학교"]}, {"sentenceText": "I''m busy every day.", "highlightingPart": "I''m busy", "sentenceTranslation": "저는 매일 바빠요.", "practiceQuestion": "Maybe we can talk later?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "나중에 얘기할 수 있을까요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2045/practice-examples/57b928ac-6451-4225-aecd-bb2686316a9e.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I''m", "busy", "every", "day"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["days", "busy", "I''m", "never", "day", "busier", "every"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["저는", "매일", "바빠요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["가끔", "당신은", "저는", "매일", "바빠요", "한가해요"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',1,now(),now()),
(2046,16,'POLITE_EXPRESSION','BASIC','EN','KR',4,'Have a nice day','좋은 하루 보내세요','대화를 기분 좋게 마무리하는 Have a nice day','대화를 마치고 헤어질 때 상대에게 건네는 인사예요. 거절한 뒤에 이 말을 덧붙이면 분위기가 훨씬 부드러워져요. 저녁에는 nice 자리에 good을, day 자리에 evening을 넣어도 돼요.','Okay. Have a nice day!','알겠어요. 좋은 하루 보내세요!','Thanks, have a nice day too.','감사합니다, 좋은 하루 보내세요.',ARRAY['Thanks','have','a','nice','day','too']::varchar[],ARRAY['a','nice','too','have','Thanks','had','day','Thank','night']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2046/representative/c9a5e525-1f8f-48ee-8cd8-54df4821f5ef.webp','[{"sentenceText": "You too. Have a nice day.", "highlightingPart": "Have a nice day", "sentenceTranslation": "당신도요. 좋은 하루 보내세요.", "practiceQuestion": "Okay. Have a nice day!", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "알겠어요. 좋은 하루 보내세요!", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["You", "too", "Have", "a", "nice", "day"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["You", "too", "day", "nice", "your", "night", "Have", "had", "a"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["당신도요", "좋은", "하루", "보내세요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["보냈어요", "나쁜", "좋은", "보내세요", "저도요", "하루", "당신도요"]}, {"sentenceText": "Have a nice day, sir.", "highlightingPart": "Have a nice day", "sentenceTranslation": "좋은 하루 보내세요, 선생님.", "practiceQuestion": "I''ll go now. Take care.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이만 갈게요. 잘 지내세요.", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Have", "a", "nice", "day", "sir"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["night", "had", "nice", "Have", "sir", "day", "days", "a"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["좋은", "하루", "보내세요", "선생님"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["나쁜", "하루", "선생님", "보냈어요", "보내세요", "좋은", "저녁"]}, {"sentenceText": "It''s okay. Have a nice day.", "highlightingPart": "Have a nice day", "sentenceTranslation": "괜찮아요. 좋은 하루 보내세요.", "practiceQuestion": "Sorry for bothering you.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "귀찮게 해서 죄송해요.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2046/practice-examples/18ac2ad4-3db5-4e7f-aef9-253626b92fcd.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It''s", "okay", "Have", "a", "nice", "day"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["had", "day", "nice", "a", "It''s", "Have", "night", "okay", "was"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["괜찮아요", "좋은", "하루", "보내세요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["좋은", "보내세요", "나쁜", "싫어요", "괜찮아요", "하루", "보냈어요"]}, {"sentenceText": "No problem. Have a nice day.", "highlightingPart": "Have a nice day", "sentenceTranslation": "별말씀을요. 좋은 하루 보내세요.", "practiceQuestion": "Thanks for being honest.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "솔직하게 말해 줘서 고마워요.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2046/practice-examples/fa35f518-a74d-4f5c-9dfc-43c079ea6c51.webp", "sentenceWords": ["No", "problem", "Have", "a", "nice", "day"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["night", "problems", "had", "No", "problem", "Have", "day", "a", "nice"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["별말씀을요", "좋은", "하루", "보내세요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["하루", "좋은", "보냈어요", "보내세요", "죄송해요", "별말씀을요", "나쁜"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',1,now(),now()),
(2047,16,'POLITE_EXPRESSION','BASIC','EN','KR',1,'Thanks anyway','그래도 고마워요','거절한 뒤 마음만 받겠다고 전하는 Thanks anyway','원하는 답을 주지 못했지만 상대의 호의는 고맙다고 전하는 표현이에요. anyway가 ''그래도''라는 느낌을 더해서 거절 뒤에 붙이기 딱 좋아요. 문장 앞뒤 어디에 놓아도 자연스럽게 들려요.','Hi, sorry to stop you. Would you be interested in getting coffee sometime?','안녕하세요, 갑자기 불러 세워서 죄송해요. 언제 커피 한잔하실 생각 있으세요?','I''ll pass, but thanks anyway.','사양할게요, 그래도 고마워요.',ARRAY['I''ll','pass','but','thanks','anyway']::varchar[],ARRAY['thank','passed','pass','however','thanks','I''ll','anyway','but']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2047/representative/1d62c51a-3707-4430-8c05-af848f0f8850.webp','[{"sentenceText": "No, but thanks anyway.", "highlightingPart": "thanks anyway", "sentenceTranslation": "아니요, 그래도 고마워요.", "practiceQuestion": "Would you be interested in getting coffee sometime?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "언제 커피 한잔하실 생각 있으세요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["No", "but", "thanks", "anyway"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["anyway", "however", "but", "No", "thank", "Yes", "thanks"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["아니요", "그래도", "고마워요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["고마워요", "그래서", "그래도", "미안해요", "아니요", "네"]}, {"sentenceText": "Please don''t wait. Thanks anyway.", "highlightingPart": "Thanks anyway", "sentenceTranslation": "기다리지 마세요. 그래도 고마워요.", "practiceQuestion": "I can wait if you''re busy now.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "지금 바쁘시면 기다릴 수 있어요.", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Please", "don''t", "wait", "Thanks", "anyway"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Thanks", "wait", "anyway", "Please", "don''t", "thank", "however", "waited"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["기다리지", "마세요", "그래도", "고마워요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["고마워요", "그래서", "마세요", "그래도", "기다렸어요", "기다리지", "미안해요"]}, {"sentenceText": "I''d rather not, but thanks anyway.", "highlightingPart": "thanks anyway", "sentenceTranslation": "안 받을게요, 그래도 고마워요.", "practiceQuestion": "Maybe I could give you my number?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "제 번호라도 드릴까요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2047/practice-examples/8b9d1302-2180-4d99-b964-6544c3d1ca90.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I''d", "rather", "not", "but", "thanks", "anyway"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["would", "anyway", "I''d", "thank", "thanks", "however", "but", "rather", "not"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["안", "받을게요", "그래도", "고마워요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["그래도", "미안해요", "잘", "안", "받았어요", "받을게요", "고마워요"]}, {"sentenceText": "Don''t worry about it. Thanks anyway.", "highlightingPart": "Thanks anyway", "sentenceTranslation": "신경 쓰지 마세요. 그래도 고마워요.", "practiceQuestion": "Sorry for stopping you like this.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이렇게 불러 세워서 죄송해요.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2047/practice-examples/67e0e860-93b3-499d-9074-af012ee1c30b.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Don''t", "worry", "about", "it", "Thanks", "anyway"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Don''t", "anyway", "it", "thank", "about", "however", "worry", "Thanks", "worried"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["신경", "쓰지", "마세요", "그래도", "고마워요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["그래서", "미안해요", "주세요", "고마워요", "마세요", "쓰지", "신경", "그래도"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',2,now(),now()),
(2048,16,'TIME_PLANNING','BASIC','EN','KR',2,'Maybe another time','다음 기회에요','지금은 아니라고 부드럽게 미루는 Maybe another time','지금은 어렵다는 뜻을 다음을 기약하는 말로 부드럽게 전하는 표현이에요. Maybe가 앞에 붙어서 확답이 아니라는 느낌을 줘요. 딱 잘라 거절하기 부담스러울 때 쓰기 좋아요.','Hi, sorry to stop you. Would you be interested in getting coffee sometime?','안녕하세요, 갑자기 불러 세워서 죄송해요. 언제 커피 한잔하실 생각 있으세요?','Maybe another time, not today.','다음 기회에요, 오늘은 아니에요.',ARRAY['Maybe','another','time','not','today']::varchar[],ARRAY['times','today','tomorrow','not','Maybe','time','other','another']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2048/representative/a08653f6-cc05-4692-9182-906622ea9112.webp','[{"sentenceText": "Maybe another time. I''m busy today.", "highlightingPart": "Maybe another time", "sentenceTranslation": "다음 기회에요. 오늘은 바빠요.", "practiceQuestion": "Would you be interested in getting coffee sometime?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "언제 커피 한잔하실 생각 있으세요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Maybe", "another", "time", "I''m", "busy", "today"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["another", "time", "Maybe", "I''m", "today", "other", "busy", "times", "tomorrow"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["다음", "기회에요", "오늘은", "바빠요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["기회에요", "오늘은", "지난", "바빠요", "다음", "내일은", "한가해요"]}, {"sentenceText": "Maybe another time. Friday doesn''t work.", "highlightingPart": "Maybe another time", "sentenceTranslation": "다음 기회에요. 금요일은 안 돼요.", "practiceQuestion": "How about this Friday?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이번 주 금요일은 어떠세요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Maybe", "another", "time", "Friday", "doesn''t", "work"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["another", "worked", "times", "doesn''t", "other", "Maybe", "time", "Friday", "work"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["다음", "기회에요", "금요일은", "안", "돼요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["안", "돼요", "지난", "월요일은", "잘", "금요일은", "다음", "기회에요"]}, {"sentenceText": "I''m just saying maybe another time.", "highlightingPart": "maybe another time", "sentenceTranslation": "그냥 다음 기회에 하자는 뜻이에요.", "practiceQuestion": "Are you saying no forever?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "영영 안 된다는 말씀이세요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2048/practice-examples/f74ba7df-146d-4d6f-939b-eeea0f1bfb15.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I''m", "just", "saying", "maybe", "another", "time"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["just", "another", "maybe", "time", "saying", "said", "times", "I''m", "other"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["그냥", "다음", "기회에", "하자는", "뜻이에요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["다음", "기회에", "하자는", "지난", "말자는", "그냥", "뜻이었어요", "뜻이에요"]}, {"sentenceText": "Maybe another time would be better.", "highlightingPart": "Maybe another time", "sentenceTranslation": "다음 기회가 더 좋을 것 같아요.", "practiceQuestion": "Should I ask you again next week?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "다음 주에 다시 여쭤볼까요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2048/practice-examples/634c5f7c-e117-49c7-a1f2-deaf8b5be303.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Maybe", "another", "time", "would", "be", "better"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["worse", "Maybe", "be", "would", "times", "better", "other", "time", "another"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["다음", "기회가", "더", "좋을", "것", "같아요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["좋을", "덜", "기회가", "것", "지난", "더", "같아요", "다음", "싫을"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',2,now(),now()),
(2049,16,'RELATIONSHIP_SOCIAL','BASIC','EN','KR',3,'I''m seeing someone','만나는 사람이 있어요','연애 상대가 있다고 알리는 I''m seeing someone','지금 만나는 사람이 있다고 알리는 표현이에요. see는 ''보다''지만 진행형으로 쓰면 사귀는 사이라는 뜻이 돼요. 이유를 분명히 밝히는 거절이라 상대도 쉽게 납득해요.','Hi, sorry to stop you. Would you be interested in getting coffee sometime?','안녕하세요, 갑자기 불러 세워서 죄송해요. 언제 커피 한잔하실 생각 있으세요?','I''m seeing someone right now.','저는 지금 만나는 사람이 있어요.',ARRAY['I''m','seeing','someone','right','now']::varchar[],ARRAY['anyone','I''m','now','then','seeing','saw','right','someone']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2049/representative/ca1c43a0-65f8-4fb6-af15-c17dab7d19c4.webp','[{"sentenceText": "Sorry, I''m seeing someone.", "highlightingPart": "I''m seeing someone", "sentenceTranslation": "죄송해요, 저는 만나는 사람이 있어요.", "practiceQuestion": "Would you be interested in getting coffee sometime?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "언제 커피 한잔하실 생각 있으세요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Sorry", "I''m", "seeing", "someone"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["saw", "someone", "Thanks", "anyone", "Sorry", "seeing", "I''m"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["죄송해요", "저는", "만나는", "사람이", "있어요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["고마워요", "당신은", "사람이", "만나는", "있어요", "저는", "없어요", "죄송해요"]}, {"sentenceText": "Yes, I''m seeing someone these days.", "highlightingPart": "I''m seeing someone", "sentenceTranslation": "네, 요즘 만나는 사람이 있어요.", "practiceQuestion": "Do you have a boyfriend?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "남자친구 있으세요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Yes", "I''m", "seeing", "someone", "these", "days"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["saw", "someone", "these", "I''m", "Yes", "anyone", "days", "No", "seeing"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["네", "요즘", "만나는", "사람이", "있어요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["아니요", "네", "있어요", "사람이", "요즘", "없어요", "예전에", "만나는"]}, {"sentenceText": "Right, I''m seeing someone already.", "highlightingPart": "I''m seeing someone", "sentenceTranslation": "맞아요, 저는 이미 만나는 사람이 있어요.", "practiceQuestion": "Is that why you said no?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그래서 거절하신 거예요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2049/practice-examples/85b2a12c-7209-4a75-bf96-8a0d22b3b5fe.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Right", "I''m", "seeing", "someone", "already"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["seeing", "saw", "Wrong", "already", "Right", "I''m", "someone", "anyone"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["맞아요", "저는", "이미", "만나는", "사람이", "있어요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["만나는", "사람이", "맞아요", "있어요", "저는", "아니에요", "이미", "없어요", "아직"]}, {"sentenceText": "I''m seeing someone, so no thanks.", "highlightingPart": "I''m seeing someone", "sentenceTranslation": "만나는 사람이 있어서 사양할게요.", "practiceQuestion": "Could we just be friends then?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "그럼 친구로 지내면 안 될까요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2049/practice-examples/090a29a4-7823-4893-aca5-4455e82f3161.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I''m", "seeing", "someone", "so", "no", "thanks"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["thank", "thanks", "I''m", "seeing", "so", "saw", "no", "anyone", "someone"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["만나는", "사람이", "있어서", "사양할게요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["있어서", "없어서", "사람이", "사양할게요", "만나는", "친구가", "받을게요"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',3,now(),now()),
(2050,16,'POLITE_EXPRESSION','BASIC','EN','KR',4,'I appreciate it','감사해요','상대의 배려를 진심으로 고마워하는 I appreciate it','Thank you보다 조금 더 어른스럽고 진심이 느껴지는 감사 표현이에요. appreciate는 상대가 해 준 행동의 가치를 안다는 뜻이라 무게가 있어요. 거절 뒤에 붙이면 상대의 마음을 존중한다는 느낌이 살아나요.','I understand. Thanks for being clear, and have a good day.','알겠습니다. 분명히 말씀해 주셔서 고마워요, 좋은 하루 보내세요.','You too. I appreciate it.','당신도요. 감사해요.',ARRAY['You','too','I','appreciate','it']::varchar[],ARRAY['it','too','them','I','appreciate','You','your','appreciated']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2050/representative/5ca6fe97-6e9b-463a-b5c5-df20de3346b7.webp','[{"sentenceText": "Of course. I appreciate it.", "highlightingPart": "I appreciate it", "sentenceTranslation": "당연하죠. 저야말로 감사해요.", "practiceQuestion": "Thanks for being clear with me.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "분명하게 말씀해 주셔서 고마워요.", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Of", "course", "I", "appreciate", "it"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["I", "courses", "it", "appreciate", "them", "course", "appreciated", "Of"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["당연하죠", "저야말로", "감사해요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["저야말로", "감사해요", "당연하죠", "아니죠", "감사했어요", "당신이야말로"]}, {"sentenceText": "Not at all. I appreciate it.", "highlightingPart": "I appreciate it", "sentenceTranslation": "전혀요. 오히려 감사해요.", "practiceQuestion": "I hope you''re not upset.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "기분 상하지 않으셨길 바라요.", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Not", "at", "all", "I", "appreciate", "it"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Not", "in", "all", "appreciate", "I", "them", "at", "it", "appreciated"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["전혀요", "오히려", "감사해요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["감사해요", "감사했어요", "미안해요", "오히려", "전혀요", "많이요"]}, {"sentenceText": "Thank you, I appreciate it.", "highlightingPart": "I appreciate it", "sentenceTranslation": "고마워요, 정말 감사해요.", "practiceQuestion": "I''ll leave you alone now.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "이제 그만 방해할게요.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2050/practice-examples/8dbe33a1-817d-4be7-b50a-65f01b96c1f5.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Thank", "you", "I", "appreciate", "it"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["Thank", "you", "I", "Thanks", "it", "appreciate", "appreciated", "them"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["고마워요", "정말", "감사해요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["감사했어요", "전혀", "미안해요", "정말", "고마워요", "감사해요"]}, {"sentenceText": "It''s fine. I appreciate your honesty.", "highlightingPart": "I appreciate", "sentenceTranslation": "괜찮아요. 솔직하게 말해 줘서 감사해요.", "practiceQuestion": "Sorry again for stopping you.", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "불러 세워서 다시 한번 죄송해요.", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/16/expressions/2050/practice-examples/7550ba02-bcf4-493a-bd74-94b8023f0475.webp", "sentenceWords": ["It''s", "fine", "I", "appreciate", "your", "honesty"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["appreciate", "honest", "was", "your", "fine", "honesty", "appreciated", "I", "It''s"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["괜찮아요", "솔직하게", "말해", "줘서", "감사해요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["솔직하게", "줘서", "애매하게", "감사해요", "싫어요", "괜찮아요", "말해", "감사했어요"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',3,now(),now()),
(2051,20,'TRAVEL_MOVEMENT','BASIC','EN','KR',1,'I went to ~','~에 갔어','다녀온 여행지를 알려 주는 I went to ~','어디에 다녀왔는지 말할 때 쓰는 표현이에요. go의 과거형 went를 써서 이미 끝난 여행을 이야기해요. to 뒤에 도시나 나라 이름만 넣으면 문장이 완성돼요.','What was your favorite trip?','제일 좋았던 여행이 뭐야?','I went to Jeju last summer.','작년 여름에 제주에 갔어.',ARRAY['I','went','to','Jeju','last','summer']::varchar[],ARRAY['to','I','went','Jeju','last','first','goes','summer','go']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2051/representative/1c521e03-2a02-407e-b9f0-6a97560c5f08.webp','[{"sentenceText": "I went to Japan with my family.", "highlightingPart": "I went to", "sentenceTranslation": "가족이랑 일본에 갔어.", "practiceQuestion": "Where did you go last year?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "작년에 어디 갔어?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["I", "went", "to", "Japan", "with", "my", "family"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["I", "family", "went", "my", "families", "goes", "to", "with", "Japan", "go"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["가족이랑", "일본에", "갔어"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["혼자", "갈게", "갔어", "일본에", "가족이랑", "중국에"]}, {"sentenceText": "Yes, I went to Busan in May.", "highlightingPart": "I went to", "sentenceTranslation": "응, 5월에 부산에 갔어.", "practiceQuestion": "Did you visit Busan?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "부산 가봤어?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Yes", "I", "went", "to", "Busan", "in", "May"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["on", "Busan", "Yes", "go", "May", "to", "No", "went", "in", "I"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["응", "5월에", "부산에", "갔어"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["6월에", "부산에", "갈게", "응", "아니", "갔어", "5월에"]}, {"sentenceText": "I went to Vietnam two years ago.", "highlightingPart": "I went to", "sentenceTranslation": "2년 전에 베트남에 갔어.", "practiceQuestion": "Have you been abroad?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "외국 가본 적 있어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/20/expressions/2051/practice-examples/e13d8895-93a9-46de-9bdf-6f7cf8996126.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "went", "to", "Vietnam", "two", "years", "ago"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["later", "I", "ago", "Vietnam", "to", "two", "years", "went", "go", "year"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["2년", "전에", "베트남에", "갔어"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["갈게", "후에", "전에", "2년", "베트남에", "3년", "갔어"]}, {"sentenceText": "I went to a small island.", "highlightingPart": "I went to", "sentenceTranslation": "작은 섬에 갔어.", "practiceQuestion": "What did you do last winter?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "지난 겨울에 뭐 했어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/20/expressions/2051/practice-examples/93b2541b-aa9a-4a41-aaf8-d8241878d6e8.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "went", "to", "a", "small", "island"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["island", "islands", "go", "big", "I", "went", "a", "small", "to"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["작은", "섬에", "갔어"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["큰", "섬에", "작은", "도시에", "갈게", "갔어"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',1,now(),now()),
(2052,20,'EMOTION_EMPATHY','BASIC','EN','KR',2,'It was fun','재미있었어','지난 일이 즐거웠다고 알리는 It was fun','이미 지나간 일이 즐거웠다고 말하는 표현이에요. be동사의 과거형 was를 써서 그때의 느낌을 전해요. 여행, 공연, 모임처럼 무엇을 이야기하든 그대로 쓸 수 있어요.','What did you like there?','거기서 뭐가 좋았어?','The beach was great. It was fun.','해변이 좋았어. 재미있었어.',ARRAY['The','beach','was','great','It','was','fun']::varchar[],ARRAY['was','beaches','great','was','fun','It','boring','The','beach','is']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2052/representative/3b0916df-eed7-4e0b-8855-f2913562a926.webp','[{"sentenceText": "It was fun and relaxing.", "highlightingPart": "It was fun", "sentenceTranslation": "재미있고 편했어.", "practiceQuestion": "How was the trip?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "여행 어땠어?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["It", "was", "fun", "and", "relaxing"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["fun", "was", "It", "is", "and", "relax", "relaxing", "boring"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["재미있고", "편했어"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["재미있고", "편했어", "지루하고", "힘들었어", "심심했어"]}, {"sentenceText": "Yes, it was fun.", "highlightingPart": "it was fun", "sentenceTranslation": "응, 재미있었어.", "practiceQuestion": "Did you enjoy the boat tour?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "보트 투어 재밌었어?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["Yes", "it", "was", "fun"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["No", "is", "Yes", "funny", "was", "fun", "it"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["응", "재미있었어"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["아니", "재미있었어", "무서웠어", "지루했어", "응"]}, {"sentenceText": "A little, but it was fun.", "highlightingPart": "it was fun", "sentenceTranslation": "조금, 근데 재미있었어.", "practiceQuestion": "Was the hike hard?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "등산 힘들었어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/20/expressions/2052/practice-examples/2f9cae1c-4287-44dc-86b8-ca6d2338f0e6.webp", "sentenceWords": ["A", "little", "but", "it", "was", "fun"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["is", "but", "funny", "lot", "fun", "A", "it", "was", "little"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["조금", "근데", "재미있었어"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["근데", "조금", "지루했어", "재미있었어", "많이", "무서웠어"]}, {"sentenceText": "Sure, it was fun last time.", "highlightingPart": "it was fun", "sentenceTranslation": "당연하지, 지난번에 재미있었어.", "practiceQuestion": "Would you go there again?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "거기 또 갈래?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/20/expressions/2052/practice-examples/64b30c9e-1011-44fd-9692-01ca44bf0578.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Sure", "it", "was", "fun", "last", "time"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["last", "Sure", "time", "next", "it", "is", "was", "fun", "times"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["당연하지", "지난번에", "재미있었어"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["싫어", "지루했어", "지난번에", "재미있었어", "다음에", "당연하지"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',1,now(),now()),
(2053,20,'OPINION_JUDGMENT','BASIC','EN','KR',3,'the food was good','음식이 맛있었어','여행지 음식을 칭찬하는 the food was good','여행지에서 먹은 음식이 맛있었다고 말하는 표현이에요. good은 맛뿐 아니라 전체적으로 괜찮았다는 느낌까지 담아요. 여행 이야기에서 가장 자주 나오는 칭찬이라 통째로 외워 두면 좋아요.','What did you like there?','거기서 뭐가 좋았어?','I liked the beach, and the food was good.','해변이 좋았고 음식이 맛있었어.',ARRAY['I','liked','the','beach','and','the','food','was','good']::varchar[],ARRAY['liked','like','foods','the','beach','was','and','food','I','the','good','bad']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2053/representative/ed8b6600-a906-41d9-9ebc-a88c5b0efda7.webp','[{"sentenceText": "The food was good and cheap.", "highlightingPart": "The food was good", "sentenceTranslation": "음식이 맛있고 저렴했어.", "practiceQuestion": "How was the food there?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "거기 음식 어땠어?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["The", "food", "was", "good", "and", "cheap"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["The", "is", "cheap", "was", "foods", "expensive", "good", "food", "and"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["음식이", "맛있고", "저렴했어"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["맛없고", "저렴했어", "음식이", "맛있고", "숙소가", "비쌌어"]}, {"sentenceText": "The food was good at every place.", "highlightingPart": "The food was good", "sentenceTranslation": "가는 곳마다 음식이 맛있었어.", "practiceQuestion": "What do you remember most?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "뭐가 제일 기억나?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["The", "food", "was", "good", "at", "every", "place"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["food", "place", "good", "is", "foods", "at", "every", "places", "The", "was"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["가는", "곳마다", "음식이", "맛있었어"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["맛없었어", "곳마다", "맛있었어", "음식이", "비쌌어", "가는", "숙소가"]}, {"sentenceText": "The room was small, but the food was good.", "highlightingPart": "the food was good", "sentenceTranslation": "방은 작았는데 음식이 맛있었어.", "practiceQuestion": "Was the hotel nice?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "호텔 괜찮았어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.c