(2168,9,'OPINION_JUDGMENT','BASIC','EN','KR',2,'it went well','잘 됐어','지난 일이 잘 풀렸다고 알리는 it went well','어떤 일이 무리 없이 잘 풀렸다고 말하는 표현이에요. go가 ''진행되다''라는 뜻으로 쓰여서 과거형 went가 돼요. 반대로 잘 안 됐을 땐 it went badly라고 하면 돼요.','Have you presented in English before? How did it go?','전에 영어로 발표해 본 적 있어? 어땠어?','Yes, and it went well.','응, 그리고 잘 됐어.',ARRAY['Yes','and','it','went','well']::varchar[],ARRAY['goes','badly','well','went','Yes','and','No','it']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2168/representative/46b15a08-a0f9-4b59-a8b7-9a3985aeed48.webp','[{"sentenceText": "It went well, thanks.", "highlightingPart": "It went well", "sentenceTranslation": "잘 됐어, 고마워.", "practiceQuestion": "How did your last presentation go?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "지난번 발표 어땠어?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["It", "went", "well", "thanks"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["went", "It", "badly", "well", "thanks", "goes", "thank"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["잘", "됐어", "고마워"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["미안해", "됐어", "고마워", "어려웠어", "망했어", "잘"]}, {"sentenceText": "A little, but it went well.", "highlightingPart": "it went well", "sentenceTranslation": "조금, 근데 잘 됐어.", "practiceQuestion": "Were you nervous last time?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "지난번에 긴장했어?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["A", "little", "but", "it", "went", "well"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["A", "goes", "but", "badly", "went", "lots", "it", "little", "well"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["조금", "근데", "잘", "됐어"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["망했어", "근데", "많이", "됐어", "잘", "조금", "어려웠어"]}, {"sentenceText": "I think it went well.", "highlightingPart": "it went well", "sentenceTranslation": "잘 된 것 같아.", "practiceQuestion": "Did the teacher like it?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "선생님이 좋아하셨어?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/9/expressions/2168/practice-examples/e0ee319a-5501-4d81-b4ff-0585cf6a67e9.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "think", "it", "went", "we