3-7ae7-4ee1-92b8-ceb1981f4545.webp", "sentenceWords": ["I", "think", "so", "I", "bought", "it", "last", "week"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["think", "buy", "I", "so", "bought", "weeks", "I", "week", "it", "thinks", "last"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["그럴", "거예요", "지난주에", "샀어요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["작년에", "거예요", "살게요", "지난주에", "아닐", "샀어요", "그럴"]}, {"sentenceText": "Not long. I bought it last week.", "highlightingPart": "I bought it last week", "sentenceTranslation": "얼마 안 됐어요. 지난주에 샀어요.", "practiceQuestion": "How long have you used it?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "얼마나 사용하셨어요?", "imageUrl": "https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenarios/39/expressions/2237/practice-examples/652d6e46-1578-42e7-a894-4ada4baa617c.webp", "sentenceWords": ["Not", "long", "I", "bought", "it", "last", "week"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["long", "it", "week", "weeks", "longer", "Not", "buy", "I", "bought", "last"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["얼마", "안", "됐어요", "지난주에", "샀어요"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["됐어요", "오래", "얼마", "지난주에", "작년에", "안", "샀어요", "살게요"]}]'::jsonb,'SCENARIO','ACTIVE',1,now(),now()),
(2238,39,'POLITE_EXPRESSION','BASIC','EN','KR',4,'that''s very kind','정말 친절하시네요','상대의 호의에 고마움을 표하는 that''s very kind','상대가 베푼 호의에 고맙다고 답하는 정중한 표현이에요. kind가 ''친절한''이라는 뜻이라 상대의 마음씨를 칭찬하는 말이 돼요. 뒤에 of you를 붙이면 한층 더 정중하게 들려요.','Would you like a box of tea as a gift?','선물로 차 한 상자 드릴까요?','Oh, that''s very kind. Thank you.','어머, 정말 친절하시네요. 감사합니다.',ARRAY['Oh','that''s','very','kind','Thank','you']::varchar[],ARRAY['No','was','kindly','kind','very','Thank','Oh','you','that''s']::varchar[],'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/writing-expressions/2238/representative/be858818-815c-4850-be28-4414b82316ff.webp','[{"sentenceText": "That''s very kind of you.", "highlightingPart": "That''s very kind", "sentenceTranslation": "정말 친절하시네요, 감사합니다.", "practiceQuestion": "Would you like a box of tea as a gift?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "선물로 차 한 상자 드릴까요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["That''s", "very", "kind", "of", "you"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["me", "kindly", "was", "very", "you", "That''s", "of", "kind"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["정말", "친절하시네요", "감사합니다"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["정말", "괜찮습니다", "친절하시네요", "감사합니다", "조금", "불친절하시네요"]}, {"sentenceText": "That''s very kind. Thank you so much.", "highlightingPart": "That''s very kind", "sentenceTranslation": "너무 친절하시네요. 정말 감사합니다.", "practiceQuestion": "May we send you a coupon too?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "쿠폰도 보내 드릴까요?", "imageUrl": null, "sentenceWords": ["That''s", "very", "kind", "Thank", "you", "so", "much"], "sentenceWordChoices": ["very", "kindly", "so", "you", "much", "That''s", "little", "kind", "was", "Thank"], "sentenceTranslateWords": ["너무", "친절하시네요", "정말", "감사합니다"], "sentenceTranslateWordChoices": ["너무", "친절하시네요", "죄송합니다", "불친절하시네요", "조금", "감사합니다", "정말"]}, {"sentenceText": "That''s very kind, but I''m okay.", "highlightingPart": "That''s very kind", "sentenceTranslation": "정말 친절하시네요, 그런데 괜찮아요.", "practiceQuestion": "Shall I carry the box to your car?", "practiceQuestionTranslation": "상자를